@startuml Шлюз для маппинга команды к протоколу производителя
title Шлюз для маппинга команды к протоколу производителя\n(DeviceIntegrationGateway)

participant "AutomationOrchestratorService" as AO
participant "CommandReceiver" as Receiver
participant "VendorAdapterRegistry" as Registry
participant "CommandMapper" as Mapper
participant "VendorAdapter" as Adapter
participant "EventMapper" as EventMapper
participant "Устройство" as Device
queue "Telemetry Bus" as Bus

AO -> Receiver : DeviceCommand\n{deviceId, commandType, payload}
activate Receiver

Receiver -> Registry : getAdapter(vendorType)
activate Registry
Registry --> Receiver : VendorAdapter
deactivate Registry

Receiver -> Mapper : toVendorFormat(DeviceCommand, VendorAdapter)
activate Mapper
Mapper --> Receiver : vendorCommand
deactivate Mapper

Receiver -> Adapter : send(vendorCommand)
activate Adapter
Adapter -> Device : execute(vendorCommand HTTP)
Device --> Adapter : сырой ответ\n(vendor-контракт)

Adapter -> EventMapper : toDeviceEvent(vendorResponse)
activate EventMapper
EventMapper --> Adapter : DeviceEvent\n{deviceId, eventType, value}
deactivate EventMapper

Adapter -> Bus : publish(DeviceEvent)
Adapter --> Receiver : CommandResult
deactivate Adapter

Receiver --> AO : CommandResult
deactivate Receiver
@enduml
